## Debugging Device Tree

    


```
# View compiled device tree
dtc -I dtb -O dts /sys/firmware/fdt

# Check GPIO assignments
cat /sys/kernel/debug/gpio

# Check I2C buses
i2cdetect -l
i2cdetect -y 0
```


